sequenceDiagram
 autonumber
 participant C as Provider SDK
 participant API as FastAPI
 participant DB as PostgreSQL
 participant W as Outbox Worker
 participant K as Kafka
 participant OM as OpenMeter
 participant SP as Spark
 participant M as MinIO
 C->>API: POST /usage/consume (event_id, quantity)
 API->>DB: BEGIN; verify service/key/period
 API->>DB: Check idempotency and lock counter
 alt Same accepted event
  DB-->>API: previous accepted result
  API-->>C: 200 duplicate=true; no increment
 else Quota exceeded
  DB-->>API: remaining < requested
  API-->>C: 409 QUOTA_EXCEEDED
 else Accepted
  API->>DB: insert UsageEvent + atomic counter + OutboxEvent
  DB-->>API: COMMIT (new remaining)
  API-->>C: 201 accepted; remaining
  W->>DB: Read pending event
  par independent delivery destinations
   W->>K: Publish canonical event (retryable)
   W->>OM: Ingest CloudEvent (retryable)
  end
  K->>SP: Stream events
  SP->>M: bronze -> silver -> gold (dedupe)
 end
